Priority: optional
Maintainer: Grigory Tuboltsev <gtubolcev@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               gettext,
               libgtk-3-dev (>= 3.24),
               libspeechd-dev (>= 0.11),
               libxfce4ui-2-dev (>= 4.18),
               libxfce4util-dev (>= 4.18),
               meson,
               pkgconf
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/gtubolcev/xfce4-speech-settings
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/gtubolcev/xfce4-speech-settings.git
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/gtubolcev/xfce4-speech-settings
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: xfce4-speech-settings
Architecture: any
Depends: speech-dispatcher, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: speech settings dialog for Xfce
 Chooses the language, the synthesizer and the voice of speech-dispatcher, the
 text-to-speech service of the desktop, and sets the rate, pitch, volume,
 punctuation and audio output. Has a field to test the voice.
 .
 This build appears in the Xfce settings manager. speech-settings is the same
 dialog for other desktops.

Package: speech-settings
Section: utils
Architecture: any
Depends: speech-dispatcher, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: speech settings dialog
 Chooses the language, the synthesizer and the voice of speech-dispatcher, the
 text-to-speech service of the desktop, and sets the rate, pitch, volume,
 punctuation and audio output. Has a field to test the voice.
 .
 This build needs only GTK 3; xfce4-speech-settings is the same dialog for the
